  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Backward compatible",
      "items": [
        "NewOpenAIClientWithPath 把空串归一为 /v1",
        "无该列的老 DB 记录行为完全不变",
        "Gemini 原生客户端（NewGeminiClient）不受影响"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two entry points, one provider",
      "items": [
        "快速模式：DB → NewQuickGateway → provider",
        "复杂模式：config.json → NewGateway → provider",
        "两者都调用 NewOpenAIClientWithPath，语义一致"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Re-sniff consistency",
      "items": [
        "db check 与 db update 重新探测时重写 openai_path",
        "若上游端点迁移，run --db <id> 立即用上新前缀",
        "前缀紧随记录，不放全局配置"
      ]
    }
